  "description": "Light, comfortable and fast\nCombining efficiently smooth riding with real-world capability and dependability, RHeO 1 is your perfect partner for comfortably and confidently flowing freely along the streets and bike paths.\n\nHighlights\n– Lightweight aluminum frame and fork for easy pedalling and carrying.\n– Easy to use 1x10 transmission gives you the gearing to ride everywhere easily.\n– Fast-rolling, grippy tyres and confidence-inspiring handling let you flow smoothly along even the roughest streets.\n– Reassuringly powerful and dependable all-weather hydraulic disc brakes.\n– Weighing just 12kg (size m) it's easy to lift and live with, too.\n– Ready to take a full set of mudguards, a bike rack, kick-stand and more.\n\nSmoothes out the rough\nWhether café cruising, commuting, socialising or simply exploring the roads, lanes and bike paths less travelled, RHeO 1's confident handling and road-smoothing high-volume tyres will put you in control, everywhere. Weighing just 12kg (size M) it's easy to lift and live with, too.\n\nRHeO 1 is also compatible with our RHeO aftermarket mudguards (available separately) to help keep you clean and dry, all year round.",
